# Kebab-case file names

## Scope (monorepo children)

Applies to **all child projects** of this repo (`apps/*`, `packages/*`), not only the workspace root.

Always use kebab-case for file names (e.g. `use-shell-nav.ts`, `product-card.tsx`).
